---
name: assumptions-versioning
description: PropIQ assumption and configuration versioning.
---

# Authority

DATABASE_SCHEMA_DESIGN.md

CALCULATION_SPEC.md

# Principle

No hard-coded assumptions.

Everything is versioned.

# Version Records

Store:

effective_from
effective_to
source_url
last_verified_at

# Historical Accuracy

Old deals continue using the versions active when they were created.

# Configuration

Append-only.

Never mutate historical versions.

# Forbidden

No magic numbers.

No embedded rates.

No hard-coded SDLT values.